  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "阆中抱嘉陵江两千年，太师椅落进柴米油盐。丽江得雪水八百年，避“木”字加框忌讳，连城墙都不修。凤凰吊脚楼守着沱江，边城成了乡愁。徽州城套城，镇远画太极。这五座古城活透了，却远算不上最绝#华夏文化#涨知识#千年古城#传统民俗#中国建筑",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_9f097e286011c72c_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 407.301995,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道吗？咱们国家一百多座历史文化名城，真正算得上依山傍水，又活了一千多年的挨着手指头数。也就那么十来座，有人说是凤凰沱江穿城而过，沈从文笔下的边城。有人说是镇远五阳河拐了一个太极湾。错真要论起依山傍水，这四个字，凤凰和镇远连前山都进不去。今天，咱们就来盘点中国十大移山傍水的千年古城。先讲第十到第六，一座比一座有味道。老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听。第十名。四川阆中古城在四川盆地北部嘉陵江环抱了这座城，两千三百多年古人，用八个字形容他山围，四面水绕三方什么意思？四面都是山，三面都是水，成就卧在山水中间，跟躺在太师椅上一样。阆中古城最绝的是他的格局，九十三条街巷全是井字形棋盘状，所有主阶宽度都是五到六米。这个宽度不是随便定的是顺着嘉陵江弯弯曲曲的地形一点点量出来，唐宋格局，明清风貌，两千三百年没变过。诗圣杜甫来过感叹了一句，阆州城南天下西一座城，把山水和日子过程了。一幅画第九名云南丽江古城在云南西北部玉龙雪山脚下建于，宋末元初八百多年了。这成最绝的是他没有城墙。您可能要问了一个古城，怎么能没有城墙？因为当年统治丽江的土司姓穆，木字外面加一个框就成了困子，不吉利，所以丽江古城不修墙，更觉得是他的水。玉龙雪山的冰雪融水从北边流下来，在城北分成了三股，再分成无数条细流，穿街过巷流进每家每户的门口。古城里三百多座石桥木桥，把整座城连成一片。您想想，水从雪山上下来，穿过整座城，再流出去，八百多年了。水还是那个路线，桥，还是那个位置，家家流水，户户垂杨。这城不是建在地上的，是长在水上。第八名，安徽徽州古城在黄山涉县始建于秦朝两千两百多年。这成最绝的就三个字，成套成怎么个套法？从唐代开始，这里是郡州府治所在地县制和府制，同在一座城里外面一个城，里面还有一个城府，衙在中间，县衙在旁边，一套就是一千四百多年，全国找不出第二座徽州古城，还有个别称叫没有屋顶的徽派文化艺术馆。舞风拱秀六水，回澜城里有古桥、古塔、牌坊、祠堂、民居、许国十法，是全国唯一一座八角牌坊，八根柱子，四面为和四百多年了，还立在洋河门外。您想想，山在城边，水在城下，城，在山水里头套着。这地方您去了就知道什么叫东南周鲁第七名。贵州镇远古城在贵州东部，五羊河呈s形，穿过古城，把城一分为二，北岸是旧府城，南岸，是就魏城。您爬上石平山往下看，整座城就像一幅太极图。所以镇远又叫太极古镇，这座城有两千两百多年历史，从汉高祖五年设县开始，一直是连接中原和西南的军事重镇，号称颠除索要黔东门户。当年言传争流，商贾如云，被称为西南大都会城里的青龙洞贴在悬崖上，六百年了江西会馆。福建会馆八大会馆全在。您走在青石板路上，两岸都是几百年的老房子，河水从城中间穿过，去往东能到东一座城，守着一条河，守了两千多年。第六名，湖南凤凰古城在湘西沱江穿城而过，汉代就建了县。一千多年呐，这城最绝的不是井是人。沈从文从这走出去写了一本编程，把凤凰写进了全中国人的心里。黄永玉从这儿走出去成了大画家。新西兰作家路易艾黎来过说，这是中国最美丽的小城。凤凰的吊脚楼，一半架在岸上，一半悬在沱江上，木头柱子撑着几百年了，不倒。城里有苗族，有土家族，有银饰，有蜡染、有苗鼓。晚上，沱江两岸灯火一亮，吊脚楼的影子倒在水里。您说这是成还是化？从第十到第六，浪中藏在山水里，丽江长在水上，徽州把城套在城里镇远守着太极图凤凰住在沱江上。可这五座还不是最绝的，接下来第五到第一，一做比一做狠。又一座城两千五百年没挪过窝。有一座城九百年没被淹过，还有一座被叫做华夏第一城池。他是哪座？他凭什么排第一下集马上更新。您先点个关注点，开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 830,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1050,
      "end_ms": 3690,
      "text": "咱们国家一百多座历史文化名城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4070,
      "end_ms": 6330,
      "text": "真正算得上依山傍水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7050,
      "end_ms": 10150,
      "text": "又活了一千多年的挨着手指头数。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10450,
      "end_ms": 11530,
      "text": "也就那么十来座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12130,
      "end_ms": 15170,
      "text": "有人说是凤凰沱江穿城而过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15450,
      "end_ms": 17330,
      "text": "沈从文笔下的边城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00008",
      "start_ms": 18130,
      "end_ms": 21810,
      "text": "有人说是镇远五阳河拐了一个太极湾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00009",
      "start_ms": 22170,
      "end_ms": 25230,
      "text": "错真要论起依山傍水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25250,
      "end_ms": 26010,
      "text": "这四个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26410,
      "end_ms": 29635,
      "text": "凤凰和镇远连前山都进不去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00012",
      "start_ms": 30380,
      "end_ms": 30860,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00013",
      "start_ms": 31060,
      "end_ms": 36960,
      "text": "咱们就来盘点中国十大移山傍水的千年古城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00014",
      "start_ms": 37660,
      "end_ms": 39880,
      "text": "先讲第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00015",
      "start_ms": 40060,
      "end_ms": 42340,
      "text": "一座比一座有味道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43200,
      "end_ms": 47540,
      "text": "老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47720,
      "end_ms": 50540,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00018",
      "start_ms": 51500,
      "end_ms": 52220,
      "text": "第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00019",
      "start_ms": 52680,
      "end_ms": 59340,
      "text": "四川阆中古城在四川盆地北部嘉陵江环抱了这座城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00020",
      "start_ms": 59700,
      "end_ms": 62300,
      "text": "两千三百多年古人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00021",
      "start_ms": 62300,
      "end_ms": 64950,
      "text": "用八个字形容他山围，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00022",
      "start_ms": 65090,
      "end_ms": 68065,
      "text": "四面水绕三方什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00023",
      "start_ms": 68580,
      "end_ms": 70025,
      "text": "四面都是山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00024",
      "start_ms": 70450,
      "end_ms": 71745,
      "text": "三面都是水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00025",
      "start_ms": 72190,
      "end_ms": 74655,
      "text": "成就卧在山水中间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00026",
      "start_ms": 75150,
      "end_ms": 77425,
      "text": "跟躺在太师椅上一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00027",
      "start_ms": 77930,
      "end_ms": 81215,
      "text": "阆中古城最绝的是他的格局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00028",
      "start_ms": 81570,
      "end_ms": 85235,
      "text": "九十三条街巷全是井字形棋盘状，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00029",
      "start_ms": 85760,
      "end_ms": 88085,
      "text": "所有主阶宽度都是五到六米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00030",
      "start_ms": 88520,
      "end_ms": 95015,
      "text": "这个宽度不是随便定的是顺着嘉陵江弯弯曲曲的地形一点点量出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00031",
      "start_ms": 95790,
      "end_ms": 96915,
      "text": "唐宋格局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00032",
      "start_ms": 97330,
      "end_ms": 98285,
      "text": "明清风貌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00033",
      "start_ms": 98660,
      "end_ms": 100565,
      "text": "两千三百年没变过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00034",
      "start_ms": 101060,
      "end_ms": 103575,
      "text": "诗圣杜甫来过感叹了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00035",
      "start_ms": 103960,
      "end_ms": 107165,
      "text": "阆州城南天下西一座城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00036",
      "start_ms": 107480,
      "end_ms": 109620,
      "text": "把山水和日子过程了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00037",
      "start_ms": 109620,
      "end_ms": 118270,
      "text": "一幅画第九名云南丽江古城在云南西北部玉龙雪山脚下建于，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00038",
      "start_ms": 118290,
      "end_ms": 120755,
      "text": "宋末元初八百多年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00039",
      "start_ms": 120940,
      "end_ms": 123465,
      "text": "这成最绝的是他没有城墙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00040",
      "start_ms": 124360,
      "end_ms": 126380,
      "text": "您可能要问了一个古城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00041",
      "start_ms": 126540,
      "end_ms": 127715,
      "text": "怎么能没有城墙？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00042",
      "start_ms": 128310,
      "end_ms": 130885,
      "text": "因为当年统治丽江的土司姓穆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00043",
      "start_ms": 131410,
      "end_ms": 134735,
      "text": "木字外面加一个框就成了困子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00044",
      "start_ms": 135050,
      "end_ms": 135655,
      "text": "不吉利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00045",
      "start_ms": 136150,
      "end_ms": 137905,
      "text": "所以丽江古城不修墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00046",
      "start_ms": 138310,
      "end_ms": 140130,
      "text": "更觉得是他的水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00047",
      "start_ms": 140150,
      "end_ms": 144050,
      "text": "玉龙雪山的冰雪融水从北边流下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00048",
      "start_ms": 144130,
      "end_ms": 145895,
      "text": "在城北分成了三股，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00049",
      "start_ms": 146470,
      "end_ms": 148410,
      "text": "再分成无数条细流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00050",
      "start_ms": 148650,
      "end_ms": 152095,
      "text": "穿街过巷流进每家每户的门口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00051",
      "start_ms": 152710,
      "end_ms": 155705,
      "text": "古城里三百多座石桥木桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00052",
      "start_ms": 156150,
      "end_ms": 158210,
      "text": "把整座城连成一片。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00053",
      "start_ms": 158390,
      "end_ms": 159085,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00054",
      "start_ms": 159540,
      "end_ms": 161460,
      "text": "水从雪山上下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00055",
      "start_ms": 161820,
      "end_ms": 163175,
      "text": "穿过整座城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00056",
      "start_ms": 163500,
      "end_ms": 164385,
      "text": "再流出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00057",
      "start_ms": 164940,
      "end_ms": 166000,
      "text": "八百多年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00058",
      "start_ms": 166220,
      "end_ms": 167635,
      "text": "水还是那个路线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00059",
      "start_ms": 167940,
      "end_ms": 168180,
      "text": "桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00060",
      "start_ms": 168240,
      "end_ms": 169265,
      "text": "还是那个位置，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00061",
      "start_ms": 169630,
      "end_ms": 170575,
      "text": "家家流水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00062",
      "start_ms": 170870,
      "end_ms": 171915,
      "text": "户户垂杨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00063",
      "start_ms": 172480,
      "end_ms": 174505,
      "text": "这城不是建在地上的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00064",
      "start_ms": 174700,
      "end_ms": 175775,
      "text": "是长在水上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00065",
      "start_ms": 176390,
      "end_ms": 176965,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00066",
      "start_ms": 177280,
      "end_ms": 183515,
      "text": "安徽徽州古城在黄山涉县始建于秦朝两千两百多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00067",
      "start_ms": 183950,
      "end_ms": 186405,
      "text": "这成最绝的就三个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00068",
      "start_ms": 186770,
      "end_ms": 189220,
      "text": "成套成怎么个套法？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00069",
      "start_ms": 189420,
      "end_ms": 190555,
      "text": "从唐代开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00070",
      "start_ms": 190830,
      "end_ms": 195165,
      "text": "这里是郡州府治所在地县制和府制，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00071",
      "start_ms": 195470,
      "end_ms": 197795,
      "text": "同在一座城里外面一个城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00072",
      "start_ms": 198150,
      "end_ms": 199870,
      "text": "里面还有一个城府，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00073",
      "start_ms": 199890,
      "end_ms": 200795,
      "text": "衙在中间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00074",
      "start_ms": 201330,
      "end_ms": 202465,
      "text": "县衙在旁边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00075",
      "start_ms": 202930,
      "end_ms": 205195,
      "text": "一套就是一千四百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00076",
      "start_ms": 205630,
      "end_ms": 208900,
      "text": "全国找不出第二座徽州古城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00077",
      "start_ms": 208920,
      "end_ms": 213455,
      "text": "还有个别称叫没有屋顶的徽派文化艺术馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00078",
      "start_ms": 214350,
      "end_ms": 216490,
      "text": "舞风拱秀六水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00079",
      "start_ms": 216550,
      "end_ms": 225490,
      "text": "回澜城里有古桥、古塔、牌坊、祠堂、民居、许国十法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00080",
      "start_ms": 225730,
      "end_ms": 228335,
      "text": "是全国唯一一座八角牌坊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00081",
      "start_ms": 228770,
      "end_ms": 229655,
      "text": "八根柱子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00082",
      "start_ms": 229970,
      "end_ms": 232650,
      "text": "四面为和四百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00083",
      "start_ms": 232770,
      "end_ms": 234495,
      "text": "还立在洋河门外。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00084",
      "start_ms": 235210,
      "end_ms": 235985,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00085",
      "start_ms": 236560,
      "end_ms": 237640,
      "text": "山在城边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00086",
      "start_ms": 238000,
      "end_ms": 239060,
      "text": "水在城下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00087",
      "start_ms": 239280,
      "end_ms": 239520,
      "text": "城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00088",
      "start_ms": 239580,
      "end_ms": 241265,
      "text": "在山水里头套着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00089",
      "start_ms": 241650,
      "end_ms": 246825,
      "text": "这地方您去了就知道什么叫东南周鲁第七名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00090",
      "start_ms": 247190,
      "end_ms": 249995,
      "text": "贵州镇远古城在贵州东部，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00091",
      "start_ms": 250290,
      "end_ms": 252125,
      "text": "五羊河呈s形，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00092",
      "start_ms": 252490,
      "end_ms": 253365,
      "text": "穿过古城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00093",
      "start_ms": 253930,
      "end_ms": 255535,
      "text": "把城一分为二，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00094",
      "start_ms": 255890,
      "end_ms": 257095,
      "text": "北岸是旧府城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00095",
      "start_ms": 257410,
      "end_ms": 257730,
      "text": "南岸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00096",
      "start_ms": 257730,
      "end_ms": 258465,
      "text": "是就魏城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00097",
      "start_ms": 258820,
      "end_ms": 260805,
      "text": "您爬上石平山往下看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00098",
      "start_ms": 261210,
      "end_ms": 263985,
      "text": "整座城就像一幅太极图。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00099",
      "start_ms": 264570,
      "end_ms": 267545,
      "text": "所以镇远又叫太极古镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00100",
      "start_ms": 268270,
      "end_ms": 271435,
      "text": "这座城有两千两百多年历史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00101",
      "start_ms": 272210,
      "end_ms": 274565,
      "text": "从汉高祖五年设县开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00102",
      "start_ms": 275050,
      "end_ms": 278560,
      "text": "一直是连接中原和西南的军事重镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00103",
      "start_ms": 278740,
      "end_ms": 282085,
      "text": "号称颠除索要黔东门户。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00104",
      "start_ms": 282960,
      "end_ms": 284730,
      "text": "当年言传争流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00105",
      "start_ms": 285030,
      "end_ms": 286245,
      "text": "商贾如云，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00106",
      "start_ms": 286670,
      "end_ms": 292525,
      "text": "被称为西南大都会城里的青龙洞贴在悬崖上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00107",
      "start_ms": 292980,
      "end_ms": 294895,
      "text": "六百年了江西会馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00108",
      "start_ms": 295290,
      "end_ms": 298315,
      "text": "福建会馆八大会馆全在。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00109",
      "start_ms": 298730,
      "end_ms": 300330,
      "text": "您走在青石板路上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00110",
      "start_ms": 301030,
      "end_ms": 303090,
      "text": "两岸都是几百年的老房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00111",
      "start_ms": 303830,
      "end_ms": 306090,
      "text": "河水从城中间穿过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00112",
      "start_ms": 306090,
      "end_ms": 308490,
      "text": "去往东能到东一座城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00113",
      "start_ms": 308870,
      "end_ms": 309850,
      "text": "守着一条河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00114",
      "start_ms": 310210,
      "end_ms": 311410,
      "text": "守了两千多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00115",
      "start_ms": 312550,
      "end_ms": 313210,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00116",
      "start_ms": 314250,
      "end_ms": 318610,
      "text": "湖南凤凰古城在湘西沱江穿城而过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00117",
      "start_ms": 318790,
      "end_ms": 319970,
      "text": "汉代就建了县。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00118",
      "start_ms": 320890,
      "end_ms": 322190,
      "text": "一千多年呐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00119",
      "start_ms": 322990,
      "end_ms": 325850,
      "text": "这城最绝的不是井是人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00120",
      "start_ms": 326510,
      "end_ms": 329800,
      "text": "沈从文从这走出去写了一本编程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00121",
      "start_ms": 330360,
      "end_ms": 333280,
      "text": "把凤凰写进了全中国人的心里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00122",
      "start_ms": 333760,
      "end_ms": 337680,
      "text": "黄永玉从这儿走出去成了大画家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00123",
      "start_ms": 337700,
      "end_ms": 340320,
      "text": "新西兰作家路易艾黎来过说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00124",
      "start_ms": 340320,
      "end_ms": 342760,
      "text": "这是中国最美丽的小城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00125",
      "start_ms": 342840,
      "end_ms": 344440,
      "text": "凤凰的吊脚楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00126",
      "start_ms": 344440,
      "end_ms": 346540,
      "text": "一半架在岸上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00127",
      "start_ms": 346540,
      "end_ms": 348820,
      "text": "一半悬在沱江上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00128",
      "start_ms": 348820,
      "end_ms": 351340,
      "text": "木头柱子撑着几百年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00129",
      "start_ms": 351680,
      "end_ms": 352120,
      "text": "不倒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00130",
      "start_ms": 352140,
      "end_ms": 353560,
      "text": "城里有苗族，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00131",
      "start_ms": 353940,
      "end_ms": 355000,
      "text": "有土家族，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00132",
      "start_ms": 355140,
      "end_ms": 355960,
      "text": "有银饰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00133",
      "start_ms": 356220,
      "end_ms": 357800,
      "text": "有蜡染、有苗鼓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00134",
      "start_ms": 359280,
      "end_ms": 359740,
      "text": "晚上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00135",
      "start_ms": 359760,
      "end_ms": 361595,
      "text": "沱江两岸灯火一亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00136",
      "start_ms": 362480,
      "end_ms": 364665,
      "text": "吊脚楼的影子倒在水里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00137",
      "start_ms": 365190,
      "end_ms": 367315,
      "text": "您说这是成还是化？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00138",
      "start_ms": 368090,
      "end_ms": 370055,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00139",
      "start_ms": 370470,
      "end_ms": 372255,
      "text": "浪中藏在山水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00140",
      "start_ms": 373020,
      "end_ms": 374745,
      "text": "丽江长在水上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00141",
      "start_ms": 375290,
      "end_ms": 380835,
      "text": "徽州把城套在城里镇远守着太极图凤凰住在沱江上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00142",
      "start_ms": 381390,
      "end_ms": 383965,
      "text": "可这五座还不是最绝的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00143",
      "start_ms": 384740,
      "end_ms": 386220,
      "text": "接下来第五到第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00144",
      "start_ms": 386420,
      "end_ms": 387785,
      "text": "一做比一做狠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00145",
      "start_ms": 388070,
      "end_ms": 391445,
      "text": "又一座城两千五百年没挪过窝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00146",
      "start_ms": 391910,
      "end_ms": 395185,
      "text": "有一座城九百年没被淹过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00147",
      "start_ms": 395630,
      "end_ms": 399095,
      "text": "还有一座被叫做华夏第一城池。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00148",
      "start_ms": 399380,
      "end_ms": 399980,
      "text": "他是哪座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00149",
      "start_ms": 400480,
      "end_ms": 403495,
      "text": "他凭什么排第一下集马上更新。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00150",
      "start_ms": 404000,
      "end_ms": 405800,
      "text": "您先点个关注点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_9f097e286011c72c_s00151",
      "start_ms": 405800,
      "end_ms": 407185,
      "text": "开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
